this is an example of one of those hardcoded things (hopefully this is correct)```
if (SMS_isDivingMap()) {
    if ((status & 0xFFFF0000) == 0x10020000) {
        if ((status & 0xFFFF) == 0x370 || status == 0x891 || status == 0x1302) {
            return false;
        }
    }
}
```
The game will not accept a status on the diving map if it matches any of this criteria it seems.

```void MSBgm::setVolume(u32 param1, f32 param2, u32 param3, u8 param4)
{
    MSBgm* bgm = JALListS<MSBgm, u32>::search(param1 & 0x3FF);
    if (bgm && bgm->unk_14) {
    bgm->unk_14->setVolume(param2,param3,param4);
  }
}```
